          "It's fine though, isnt it?",
          "Everything is fine. Skely",
          "over there is keeping me",
          "company. Day in. Day out.",
          "Never leaving my side."
        ],
        [
          "Day 23",
          "",
          "Skely is angry with me, I",
          "don't know why. I snapped at",
          "him earlier; for what, I don't",
          "remember. My mind is",
          "slowly deteriorating. This",
          "swamp is evil, I just want it",
          "to stop. To be over. Please",
          "someone find me..."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
          "Day 35",
          "",
          "A month it's been. Yes, over",
