          "my new home with new",
          "friends and creatures and",
          "mushrooms and vines and",
          "plants and oooh Skely. Yes",
          "Skely is back, I like Skely.",
          "I'm friends with Skely again.",
          "He doesn't do things",
          "anymore though ever since",
          "the backstabbing but we don't",
          "talk about that. No we don't.",
          "No more death from above,"
        ],
        [
          "no no no, that scares me."
        ]
      ],
      [
        [
